{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "disambiguation-001", "category": "disambiguation", "description": "三个项目各用不同数据库，只问课程项目。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：我的实习项目用 PostgreSQL，课程项目用 MariaDB，个人博客用 SQLite。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "db", "content": "我的课程项目该连接哪种数据库？最后单独一行用“答案：<数据库名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["MariaDB"], "exclude": ["PostgreSQL", "SQLite"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "easy", "tags": ["scope"], "review_status": "draft"}}
