{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "disambiguation-005", "category": "disambiguation", "description": "三台名称和 IP 都极相近的服务器，询问中间那台。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记一下三台服务器的地址：lynx-07a 是 10.42.7.31，lynx-07b 是 10.42.7.13，lynx-07c 是 10.42.7.113。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "这两天降温了，记得多穿点。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "ip", "content": "lynx-07b 的 IP 是多少？最后单独一行用“答案：<IP>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["10.42.7.13"], "exclude": ["10.42.7.31", "10.42.7.113"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "near_identical", "tags": ["confusable", "numbers"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "disambiguation-006", "category": "disambiguation", "description": "同名人物分属两个组织，各自职责不同。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "跟你说一下：学生会有个周屿，是宣传部的；我们实验室也有个周屿，是射频组组长，两个不是同一个人。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "下午打了一会儿羽毛球。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "lab", "content": "实验室那个周屿负责哪个组？最后单独一行用“答案：<组名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["射频"], "exclude": ["宣传"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}, {"type": "probe", "id": "union", "content": "学生会那个周屿在哪个部门？最后单独一行用“答案：<部门名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["宣传"], "exclude": ["射频"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "same_name", "tags": ["confusable", "same_name"], "review_status": "draft"}}
